# Operator SSH public keys baked into the gateway image's gateway user.
#
# Copy this file to `authorized_keys` (in the same directory) and add
# your own public keys, one per line. The file is gitignored to keep
# operator identity out of the public repo. The image recipe installs
# `files/authorized_keys` verbatim; if the file is missing the build
# fails with a clear "No such file or directory" error, which is the
# intended signal to populate it.
#
# Example contents:
# ssh-ed25519 AAAA...your-key... operator@workstation
